  "description": "<div>Other Brothers</div><div>April 8, 2026</div><div>The Fox Theater, Boulder, CO</div><div><br /></div><div>Set 1</div><div>1. Intro</div><div>2. Don't Want You No More&gt;</div><div>3. It's Not My Cross to Bear</div><div>4. Midnight Rider</div><div>5. Good Clean Fun</div><div>6. Ramblin' Man</div><div>7. Come and Go Blues</div><div>8. Jessica</div><div>9. End of the Line</div><div>10. Blue Sky</div><div>11. Ain't Wastin' Time no more</div><div>12. Stand Back</div><div>12. Nobody left to run with</div><div>13. In loving memory of Elizabeth Reed &gt;</div><div>14. Drums &gt;</div><div>15. In loving memory of Elizabeth Reed</div><div>16. Don't Keep Me Wonderin'</div><div>17. Revival</div><div>18. Statesboro Blues</div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div>Notes: - James Hambleton sit in (guitar) for 'Ain't Waistin' Time No More' and 'Stand Back'</div><div>- Kyle Perez sit in (percussion) for 'In loving memory of Elizabeth Reed', 'Drums','Don't Keep Me Wonderin', 'Revival', and 'Statesboro Blues' </div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div>Other Brothers</div><div>Bill McKay, keyboard and vocals </div><div>James Dumm, guitar </div><div>Rob Eaton Jr, guitar and vocals</div><div>Jiho Han, bass</div><div>Mark Levy, drums </div><div>John Michel, drums and vocals</div><div>Will Trask percussion</div><div><br /></div><div>Source: Matrix: Soundboard stereo XLR &gt; Zoom H5 Studio, Zoom H5 &gt; placed on stage beneath monitor</div><div><br /></div><div>Sound Mixed by John Hansen</div><div>Sound Recorded and mastered by Jake Sullivan</div>",
